        {
            "citation":"The union of the Who's On First county records Yahukimo (102072971), Tolikara (102073143), Jayawijaya (102073171), Pegunungan Bintang (102073467), Lanny Jaya (1108796885), Mamberamo Tengah (1108796889), Asmat (1108796893), Yalimo (1108796901). Each member is assigned to the province that GeoNames files most of the populated places inside its boundary under, counted on 2026-11-26. The assignment agrees with the regencies each statute lists. Record 1108796893 is titled Asmat and lies in the highlands, where GeoNames files 2 of the 3 populated places inside it under Papua Pegunungan. The Asmat regency of Papua Selatan is record 102073423.",
